# RallyHQ design lock

The canonical RallyHQ UI is saved on branch **`design-backup-working`**. Do not change visual design unless the user explicitly asks.

## Do not modify without explicit request

- Colors, fonts, typography scale
- Layout, spacing, grid structure
- Cards, buttons, chips, form styling
- Navigation (NavShell links, order, labels)
- Dashboard and chart styling (Charts.jsx, stats page layout)
- globals.css design tokens and component primitives (`.card`, `.btn-*`, `.input`, etc.)

## Allowed without design approval

- Backend logic, API routes, database schema
- New features that reuse existing classes (`card`, `btn-primary`, `btn-ghost`, `input`, `label`, modal pattern)
- Bug fixes that do not alter appearance
- Stat sheet upload/functionality on `/stats/upload` using existing RallyHQ patterns

## When adding UI

Match existing components: read nearby pages and reuse the same Tailwind classes and patterns. Never introduce new color palettes, layout systems, or component styles.
